We expect the next legislative elections in France to be held in 1924.

- @menu_for_december_1922: Damn.

  
@protest_with_coal
subtitle: We can default on our coal and timber deliveries.
on-arrival: ruhr_occupation_imminent = 1; france_relation -= 5; dvp_relation += 4; kpd_relation += 2*(1-dissent); inflation += 2

Let's see how long those frog-eaters can keep their factories warm without our resources...


@nothing_ever_happens_guess_so
subtitle: We will keep up our deliveries until another deal can be arranged.
on-arrival: dvp_relation -= 2; old_middle_ddp -= 2; new_middle_spd -= 2; rural_z -= 2; unemployed_spd -= 2; unemployed += 0.1; inflation += 1

This decision might be unpopular but it is necessary, Erfüllungspolitik continues.








  
